{%- comment -%}
  Longeva Sesami booking button.

  Renders the Sesami Experience web component when a service id is
  available so the booking flow opens inline without a page hop. Falls
  back to a standard anchor when the service id is not yet set.

  Parameters:
    service_id    Sesami service id. When blank the snippet falls back.
    variant_id    Shopify product variant id (numeric). When set, the
                  <sesami-experience> is wrapped in a <form action="/cart/add">
                  so Sesami's ws() form-discovery returns this form
                  AND its closest('form[action*="/cart/add"]') traversal
                  finds the experience-element-as-child, which means
                  Sesami's hidden fields wrapper (properties[Date],
                  properties[Time], properties[Team Member],
                  properties[_reservation_token], etc.) gets included
                  when Sesami calls new FormData(form). Without the
                  wrap, Sesami uses a detached form and the slot
                  metadata is dropped from the cart line.
    shop_id       Sesami shop id. Falls back to settings.longeva_sesami_shop_id.
    label         Button label. Falls back to settings.longeva_book_cta_label.
    variant       primary | ghost | primary-on-dark (default: primary).
    fallback_url  URL used when service_id is blank.
    classes       Additional class names on the anchor / host.
    id            Optional DOM id.
    auto_add      Set to false to disable auto-add-to-cart (default: true).
    skip_cart     Set to true to skip cart drawer + go to checkout (default: false).

  Configuration history (2026-05-08, item 4.6 escalated):

  Iteration 1: both flags `true` (auto-add ON, skip-cart ON).
    Behaviour: slot click attempted silent auto-add + checkout redirect.
    If the Sesami dashboard service-to-variant binding was off (variant
    inactive, no inventory, no variant linked), step 1 silently failed
    and the user saw nothing happen. Reported as "click does nothing".

  Iteration 2: both flags `false`.
    Behaviour: slot picker advances date -> time, then stops. The
    Sesami web component requires auto-add-to-cart to progress past
    slot selection; with it off, the picker is a dead-end UI.

  Iteration 3 (current): auto_add `true`, skip_cart `false`.
    Behaviour: slot click -> calendar -> time -> auto-add to cart ->
    redirects to /cart (the on-brand longeva cart page from PR #192).
    User sees the booking line item with Sesami booking attributes,
    clicks "Secure checkout", and Shopify checkout collects name,
    email, phone, payment as per the standard Shopify Sesami flow.
    This is the canonical book-and-pay path.

    If the user STILL sees nothing after time pick under this config,
    the failure is in Sesami's auto-add-to-cart step itself. Root
    cause is Sesami dashboard service-to-variant binding (admin-side
    only). Anthony to verify:
      1. Sesami dashboard > Services > each service is linked to a
         published Shopify product variant.
      2. Variant status: Active (not Draft).
      3. Inventory: tracking disabled OR variant has stock.

  Sesami button-style JSON keys (per Sesami configurator output):
    color, color_background, border_color, border_width,
    border_radius, font_size, width, height, alignment.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign svc_id = service_id | default: '' | strip
  assign vid = variant_id | default: '' | strip
  assign shop_handle = shop_id | default: settings.longeva_sesami_shop_id | default: ''
  assign btn_label = label | default: settings.longeva_book_cta_label | default: 'Book a consultation'
  assign btn_variant = variant | default: 'primary'
  assign extra_classes = classes | default: ''
  assign host_id = id | default: ''
  assign fallback = fallback_url | default: settings.longeva_book_cta_url | default: '/pages/book'
  assign use_auto_add = auto_add
  if use_auto_add == nil
    assign use_auto_add = true
  endif
  assign use_skip_cart = skip_cart
  if use_skip_cart == nil
    assign use_skip_cart = false
  endif
  comment
    Optional pre-filled booking line property (e.g. Destination set from a
    destination page), carried into the cart line so the clinician sees it.
  endcomment
  assign prop_name = prop_name | default: '' | strip
  assign prop_value = prop_value | default: '' | strip
  comment
    Optional trip-detail prompts (destination booking, Anthony 3 June).
    When enabled, travel date and length of stay are collected in the same
    /cart/add form so they ride into the cart line as booking properties
    alongside the Sesami slot metadata. Only shown in the form branch.
  endcomment
  assign want_travel_date = ask_travel_date | default: false
  assign want_length_of_stay = ask_length_of_stay | default: false
-%}

{%- if svc_id != '' and shop_handle != '' -%}
  {%- case btn_variant -%}
    {%- when 'ghost' -%}
      {%- assign btn_bg = '#F2E6DC' -%}
      {%- assign btn_text = '#2D190E' -%}
      {%- assign btn_border = '#2D190E' -%}
    {%- when 'primary-on-dark' -%}
      {%- assign btn_bg = '#F2E6DC' -%}
      {%- assign btn_text = '#2D190E' -%}
      {%- assign btn_border = '#F2E6DC' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign btn_bg = '#2D190E' -%}
      {%- assign btn_text = '#F2E6DC' -%}
      {%- assign btn_border = '#2D190E' -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
  {%- capture btn_style -%}{"width":"100%","height":"56px","font_size":15,"color":"{{ btn_text }}","color_background":"{{ btn_bg }}","border_width":2,"border_color":"{{ btn_border }}","border_radius":999,"alignment":"center"}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if vid != '' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Wrap the <sesami-experience> in a /cart/add form so Sesami's
      ws() form-discovery finds it via t.closest('form[action*="/cart/add"]'),
      which means the hidden fields Sesami injects inside the
      experience element (properties[Date], properties[Time],
      properties[Team Member], properties[_reservation_token],
      properties[_locale], properties[_session-id]) all get included
      in new FormData(form) on submit. Without the wrap the slot
      metadata is dropped from the cart line.

      vo() validation requires <input type="submit"> or
      <button type="submit"> inside the form. The inset hidden submit
      button satisfies that. tabindex=-1 + aria-hidden so AT skips it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <form
      class="longeva-sesami-form"
      action="{{ routes.cart_url }}/add"
      method="post"
      enctype="multipart/form-data"
      data-sesami-cart-form
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="product">
      <input type="hidden" name="utf8" value="✓">
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ vid | escape }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
      {%- if prop_name != '' and prop_value != '' -%}<input type="hidden" name="properties[{{ prop_name | escape }}]" value="{{ prop_value | escape }}">{%- endif -%}
      {%- if want_travel_date or want_length_of_stay -%}
        <div class="longeva-sesami-trip">
          {%- if want_travel_date -%}
            <label class="longeva-sesami-trip__field">
              <span class="longeva-sesami-trip__label">Travel date</span>
              <input class="longeva-sesami-trip__input" type="date" name="properties[Travel date]" autocomplete="off">
            </label>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if want_length_of_stay -%}
            <label class="longeva-sesami-trip__field">
              <span class="longeva-sesami-trip__label">Length of stay</span>
              <input class="longeva-sesami-trip__input" type="text" name="properties[Length of stay]" placeholder="e.g. 2 weeks" autocomplete="off">
            </label>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      <sesami-experience
        class="longeva-sesami longeva-sesami--{{ btn_variant }} {{ extra_classes }}"
        {% if host_id != '' %}id="{{ host_id }}"{% endif %}
        shop-id="{{ shop_handle | escape }}"
        service-id="{{ svc_id | escape }}"
        {% if use_auto_add %}auto-add-to-cart{% endif %}
        {% if use_skip_cart %}skip-cart{% endif %}
        button-label="{{ btn_label | escape }}"
        button-style="{{ btn_style | url_encode }}"
      ></sesami-experience>
      <button type="submit" class="longeva-sr-only" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Add to cart</button>
    </form>
  {%- else -%}
    <sesami-experience
      class="longeva-sesami longeva-sesami--{{ btn_variant }} {{ extra_classes }}"
      {% if host_id != '' %}id="{{ host_id }}"{% endif %}
      shop-id="{{ shop_handle | escape }}"
      service-id="{{ svc_id | escape }}"
      {% if use_auto_add %}auto-add-to-cart{% endif %}
      {% if use_skip_cart %}skip-cart{% endif %}
      button-label="{{ btn_label | escape }}"
      button-style="{{ btn_style | url_encode }}"
    ></sesami-experience>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- case btn_variant -%}
    {%- when 'ghost' -%}
      {%- assign btn_class = 'longeva-btn longeva-btn--ghost' -%}
    {%- when 'primary-on-dark' -%}
      {%- assign btn_class = 'longeva-btn longeva-btn--primary-on-dark' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign btn_class = 'longeva-btn longeva-btn--primary-on-light' -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
  <a class="{{ btn_class }} {{ extra_classes }}"
     {% if host_id != '' %}id="{{ host_id }}"{% endif %}
     href="{{ fallback }}">{{ btn_label | escape }}</a>
{%- endif -%}
